<title>FRANCE: Rouen June 1-25 flour exports at 66,388 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen June 1-25 flour exports at 66,388 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour exports from Rouen reached 66,388 tonnes between June 1 and June 25, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Flour exports for the whole of June 1996 were 80,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>June 1-25 exports included 3,800 tonnes to West Africa, 3,000 tonnes to Algeria, 10,000 tonnes to Cuba, 10,950 tonnes to Libya, 1,742 tonnes to Sri Lanka and 36,896 tonnes to Yemen, they said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
